# EmailJS Configuration
# 1. Go to https://www.emailjs.com/
# 2. Create an account and get your public key
# 3. Add your email service (Gmail, Outlook, etc.)
# 4. Create 2 email templates for discovery and request forms
# 5. Get the Service ID and Template IDs, then fill in below:

VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_DISCOVERY=
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_REQUEST=
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=
